    "preamble": "B. Dinkar vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh on 8 January, 2024 Author: Anand Pathak Bench: Anand Pathak 1 In The High Court Of Madhya Pradesh At Gwalior Before Hon'Ble Shri Justice Anand Pathak On The 8 th Of January, 2024 Misc . Criminal Case No. 38227 of 2023 Between:- 1. B. Dinkar S/O Shri Neeraja Brungi, Aged About 38 Years , Occupation: Service Nominee Laboratory In Charge Ravi Foods Pvt. Ltd. Unit Ii 7-3-112/1/1 Sy No 74P Abd 75P Madhuban Colony Kattenddan Hydrabad Presently Residing At Gulshan Vatika Phase 1 House No E-8 Housing Board Colony Sejbahar Near Main Gate Temple Raipur Ch (Chhattisgarh) 2. Shishir Goyal S/O Shri Sharadchandra Goyal, Aged About 42 Years, Occupation: Business Proprietor Firm Nirmal Chandra Sharad Chandra Goyal Madhav Chowk . Shankar Colony, Dist. Shivpuri (Madhya Pradesh) 3. Ajit Jain S/O Shri Dinesh Chandra Jain, Aged About 38 Years, Occupation: Business , Proprrietor M/S Shanti Sales Shinde House Subhash Colony Guna House Of Mama Garments Choudharan Colony, Guna (Madhya Pradesh) .....Ap (By Shri Ankit Saxena- Advocate) And 1. The State Of Madhya Pradesh Through Food Safety Officer Food Safety Administration District Guna (Madhya Pradesh) 2. Commissioner, Food Safety And Controller Food And Drugs Ad M In Istr Ation , Edgah Hills, Bhopal B. Dinkar vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh on 8 January, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/41364296/ 1 (Madhya Pradesh) Signature Not Verified Signed by: VISHAL UPADHYAY Signing time: 08-01-2024 07:02:54 PM 2 (BY SHRI RAJEEV UPADHYAY- GOVERNMENT ADVOCATE FOR RESPONDENT/STATE) This application coming on for admission this day, t following: ORDER Instant petition has been filed under Section 482 of Cr.P.C.",
